{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225290/extras/store_page_banner_logo.png?t=1749886389\" /></div><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Spooky Dungeon</strong></i> is a fast-paced, retro-inspired dungeon crawler with a Halloween theme and procedurally generated levels. This love letter to the classic games of the 1990s brings together fast-paced combat, challenging bosses, and an engaging story with lots of quests to solve. Every dive into the dungeon is different, filled with terrifying creatures, hidden mysteries, and dark secrets waiting to be uncovered. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENTER THE DUNGEON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through hordes of skeletons, ghosts, and other eerie enemies across several unique biomes, facing down powerful bosses that stand between you and saving the town of Iseholt from its doom. Prepare yourself for a chilling adventure as All Hallows' Eve approaches!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf83 Retro FPS Aesthetic:</strong> A nostalgic visual style that captures the spirit of the 90s with modern refinements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Procedurally Generated Levels:</strong> Every dungeon dive is unique. No two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Eerie Enemies:</strong> From skeletons and ghosts to corrupted townsfolk, face a wide range of enemies lurking in the shadows.<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Challenging Bosses:</strong> Confront terrifying bosses, each with unique abilities and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\uddd9 Powerful Spells:</strong> Unlock powerful spells to defeat the onslaught of monsters as you go deeper and deeper into the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfad Halloween Madness:</strong> Immerse yourself in a spooky, Halloween-themed world filled with dark lore, mysterious characters, and chilling quests.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3225290?t=1749886389","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3225290?t=1749886389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225290/ad3433e4974b8e01781f09253dc59adc903364e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749886389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225290/ad3433e4974b8e01781f09253dc59adc903364e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749886389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225290/extras/store_page_banner_logo.png?t=1749886389\" /></div><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Spooky Dungeon</strong></i> is a fast-paced, retro-inspired dungeon crawler with a Halloween theme and procedurally generated levels. This love letter to the classic games of the 1990s brings together fast-paced combat, challenging bosses, and an engaging story with lots of quests to solve. Every dive into the dungeon is different, filled with terrifying creatures, hidden mysteries, and dark secrets waiting to be uncovered. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENTER THE DUNGEON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through hordes of skeletons, ghosts, and other eerie enemies across several unique biomes, facing down powerful bosses that stand between you and saving the town of Iseholt from its doom. Prepare yourself for a chilling adventure as All Hallows' Eve approaches!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf83 Retro FPS Aesthetic:</strong> A nostalgic visual style that captures the spirit of the 90s with modern refinements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Procedurally Generated Levels:</strong> Every dungeon dive is unique. No two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Eerie Enemies:</strong> From skeletons and ghosts to corrupted townsfolk, face a wide range of enemies lurking in the shadows.<br></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Challenging Bosses:</strong> Confront terrifying bosses, each with unique abilities and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\uddd9 Powerful Spells:</strong> Unlock powerful spells to defeat the onslaught of monsters as you go deeper and deeper into the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfad Halloween Madness:</strong> Immerse yourself in a spooky, Halloween-themed world filled with dark lore, mysterious characters, and chilling quests.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Orange Side Up"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225290/header.jpg?t=1749886389","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Sequoia 15.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or later (Apple Silicon)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stro